# Bulk SEC downloads land here. The DERA quarterly ZIP is ~99 MB compressed /
# ~402 MB uncompressed (INFOTABLE.tsv alone is 396 MB) — never commit these.
.cache/
tmp/
*.idx
*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER COMMIT: this is a CUSIP-KEYED DATABASE.
#
# data/securities.json maps ~20,000 CUSIPs to tickers. CUSIP identifiers are
# proprietary (American Bankers Association, licensed through CUSIP Global
# Services / S&P Global Market Intelligence), and committing this file to a
# public repository is redistribution of a CUSIP-keyed database — the exact
# thing the rest of this project is built to avoid. Git history is permanent and
# forks are outside our control, so a single push cannot be walked back.
#
# It costs nothing to leave out: the ingest workflow rebuilds it from the SEC's
# own fails-to-deliver files in ~31 requests on every run. The published
# artifacts carry ticker and an opaque issuerId, never the CUSIP.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/securities.json

# Rebuilt from the SEC each run by scripts/build-sectors.mjs; no need to version it.
data/sectors.json
